                </a></li><li class="hsg-list-group-item"><a href="/milestones/1937-1945/mexican-oil" class="" id="toc-mexican-oil">Mexican Expropriation of Foreign Oil, <span class="tei-date">1938</span>
                </a></li><li class="hsg-list-group-item"><a href="/milestones/1937-1945/american-isolationism" class="" id="toc-american-isolationism">American Isolationism in the <span class="tei-date">1930s</span>
